cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RNPLens, please cite the accompanying manuscript (in preparation) and this software release.
  Author list, release date and DOI are to be supplied at release.
title: "RNPLens: evaluation and diagnostic tools for protein-RNA complex predictions"
type: software
version: 0.2.0rc2
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/JeanWen-Lab/RNPLens"
authors:
  - name: "RNPLens authors (to be supplied)"
abstract: >-
  RNPLens assesses existing protein-RNA complex predictions: reference-based structural evaluation (Evaluate),
  reference-free descriptive agreement among predictions (Report), and output-validity and candidate-disagreement
  diagnostics (Diagnose). It does not predict structures and gives no calibrated probability of correctness.
keywords:
  - protein-RNA complex
  - structure prediction
  - model evaluation
  - DockQ
  - structural biology
